- [Embeddings — embedContent](https://aistudio.google.com/api-reference/embeddings/embed-content.md): Generates a text embedding vector from the input `Content` using the specified [Gemini Embedding model](/docs/models#specialized-task-models).
- [Embeddings — embedContent (v1)](https://aistudio.google.com/api-reference/embeddings/embed-content.md?api-version=v1): Generates a text embedding vector from the input `Content` using the specified [Gemini Embedding model](/docs/models#specialized-task-models).
- [Embeddings — batchEmbedContents](https://aistudio.google.com/api-reference/embeddings/batch-embed-contents.md): Generates multiple embedding vectors from the input `Content` which consists of a batch of strings represented as `EmbedContentRequest` objects.
- [Embeddings — batchEmbedContents (v1)](https://aistudio.google.com/api-reference/embeddings/batch-embed-contents.md?api-version=v1): Generates multiple embedding vectors from the input `Content` which consists of a batch of strings represented as `EmbedContentRequest` objects.
