- [Model API — get](https://aistudio.google.com/api-reference/models/get-model.md): Gets information about a specific `Model` such as its version number, token limits, [parameters](/docs/prompting-strategies#model-parameters) and other metadata.
- [Model API — get (v1)](https://aistudio.google.com/api-reference/models/get-model.md?api-version=v1): Gets information about a specific `Model` such as its version number, token limits, [parameters](/docs/prompting-strategies#model-parameters) and other metadata.
- [Model API — list](https://aistudio.google.com/api-reference/models/list-models.md): Lists the [`Model`s](/docs/models) available through the Gemini API.
- [Model API — list (v1)](https://aistudio.google.com/api-reference/models/list-models.md?api-version=v1): Lists the [`Model`s](/docs/models) available through the Gemini API.
